copyright-holders:superctr

The XV-5080 front panel.  The lamps are led<8 * strobe + data> of the panel's 4 x 8 LED
matrix (LEDS3 on key columns 1 and 5 down to LEDS0 on 4 and 8; the data lines are the rows).
Coordinates are tenths of a millimetre on the 482 x 88.1 mm plate.
-->
